{"reviews":[{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-0","r":5.0,"t":"Nicely made","x":"This satin wrap scarf is very nice. The packaging was enacted and the scarf was folded very neatly in the box. The material is soft to the touch and the color is as pictured on the box. The extra long straps make it super easy to wrap around the head for extra support. I purchased this scarf for a 2 year old who struggles keeping nightcaps on and so far so good.","h":53,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-1","r":3.0,"t":"Not satin","x":"This satin is a joke. A headscarf should be satin on top and underneath. My hair needs the satin, not my pillow.  The package arrived on time and Came in great condition. It just wasn\u2019t what I expected.","h":49,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great for a good nights sleep","x":"Once you tie this scarf, it's not going anywhere! Very comfortable material. It's very breathable and your hair will stay protected all night - I'm a wild sleeper, I even pull at my hair, face, clothing and body in my sleep so this passed my test!","h":28,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-3","r":4.0,"t":"Love the satin scarf material very well made.","x":"Overall I love the quality of the satin scarf and color. I wish it came in a dark brown its very easy to use. The only down fall is the ends when you tie around your head they slide and become loose. And the scarf slides off. They should make the ends with a different  material so it can\u2019t slide and slip out the knot.","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-4","r":5.0,"t":"Sleeping more soundly!","x":"I purchased this scarf about a month ago. I was experiencing hair breakage and wanted a satin scarf to help with retaining hair moisture. This scarf is very comfortable. I love the wide band that treats my forehead very nicely. I sleep better because I'm not concerned about damage occurring to my hair while I'm asleep. It does help my hair to retain moisture. I'm very pleased with this product.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-5","r":5.0,"t":"Keeps my (caucasian) hair in place while sleeping","x":"I have short Caucasian hair. I keep it under wraps at night, so I don't wake up to it sticking out in weird ways. This wrap does the job  and is very comfortable to sleep in.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-6","r":1.0,"t":"Stiff","x":"Did not care for this scarf , uncomfortable and stiff","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-7","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t stay on","x":"The design is not good. It never stays on no matter how you tie it. There is an inseam where your edges will be so the rough part of it is right on your edges damaging it. Don\u2019t recommend it.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-8","r":4.0,"t":"Just ok.  Same product in Dollar Tree","x":"No special feature.  Same as Dollar Tree","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-9","r":5.0,"t":"A Perfect Fit","x":"This has quickly become my favorite scarf to wear to bed. It fits perfectly, is very comfortable and stays on all night. I have a collection of night scarves and this is by far the best one. As one who tosses and turns while asleep, it's pretty amazing that this scarf doesn't budge! It leaves my hair soft and smooth each morning.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-10","r":4.0,"t":"Like it","x":"The color is what I expected, the fit is fine, it was a little more material than  I expected but it works. What I didn\u2019t like is how long the back part hung, reminded me of a guys head covering that some wear for waves. Overall it does the job, but I wouldn\u2019t purchase again because of that back hanging too long for me.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-11","r":5.0,"t":"No bonnet for me","x":"I love this wrap scarf I wear braids, but this scarf keeps them neat, while protecting my edges. The color is beautiful, its soft and looks luxurious.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-12","r":5.0,"t":"Holds hair in place all night long","x":"This scarf is great. I was worried that it would slip off at night. It doesn\u2019t. The design holds my hair in place all night.  I will be purchasing another one.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-13","r":5.0,"t":"just what I needed","x":"This is a really nice satin scarf & perfect for protecting my relaxed hair. It is big & soft. It doesn't stretch like the ones you see for men, & that's exactly what I wanted.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-14","r":2.0,"t":"Not satin on the inside","x":"I feel mislead regarding the material of this scarf. Yes it\u2019s satin scarf but the satin finish is only on the outside and not the side that actually touches your hair. You can wear it outside in so that the shiny satin side can touch your hair. The length is 34.5\u201d x 17\u201d (head to tail).","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-15","r":3.0,"t":"It doesn\u2019t stay on your head .","x":"I love the softness, but it doesn\u2019t stay on ur head if your trying to sleep . It falls off each time .","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-16","r":3.0,"t":"CHEAP BUT DONT DO IT","x":"My edges had started to thin out after wearing to many tights buns, so I tried going cheap and buying a few evolve head scarfs. Not a good idea. They help in the sense of keeping your hair from getting wild at night and keeping it in place but that\u2019s it. This will NOT help with edges or keep hair looking healthy and shiny. The outside material is softer than the inside which you put on your hair which makes no sense. I ended up flipping it inside out and using it that way for a while. This scarf","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-17","r":5.0,"t":"Styled hairs friend","x":"One of my more favorite scarfs for styled hair. Definently keeps edges freshly placed and flyaways contained. Silk for sleep makes hair feel clean and refreshed for days and is really cute styled.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-18","r":1.0,"t":"Snatched Out My Edges!","x":"Satin is not silk! The satin scarf snatched out some of my edges in the back of my head. Doesn\u2019t stay on. Definitely not good. Spend the extra money and get 100% SILK!","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-19","r":5.0,"t":"Protects Edges","x":"This wrap doesn\u2019t pull on my edges like some wraps. It\u2019s just what I needed to help grow my edges in.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-20","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s not what I was expecting \u2026","x":"it\u2019s too large for my head.  Not the best fit .","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great stuff","x":"I love it.  It does not slide off my head,","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-22","r":5.0,"t":"Scarf","x":"I love this scarf.  I had to buy this scarf because I keep my hair in braids now, but I wanted a real good scarf so even when I take out the braids, I can use the scarf to protect my natural hair.  This scarf is great for exactly that.  It's good for the braids and it's good for the natural hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-23","r":1.0,"t":"FOR LARGE HEADS ONLY","x":"Had hoped to use this for nighttime after I noticed a little hair loss. Unfortunately, this scarf is HUGE!!! I couldn\u2019t think of any way I could have gotten it to work for me. To the manufacturer: please consider making this in a smaller size.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07K5MGRZS-24","r":5.0,"t":"Nice material and stays on.","x":"Love it because I needed a new replacement hair wrap and finally bought one and this is better than my previous one. It has such a nice look to it and feels great on, nice quality material and not cheap. 10/10","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the scarf soft, comfortable, and well made.","cites":[1,3,4,5,6,10,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it stays on and holds hair in place all night, even for restless sleepers.","cites":[3,10,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain the satin is only on the outside, not the side touching the hair.","cites":[2,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers report the scarf slips off or the ends come loose when tied.","cites":[4,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers find it stiff, uncomfortable, or not worth the price compared to cheaper alternatives.","cites":[7,9]}]},"qa":[]}